==Battleground==
*Infinite [[B.B.Bunny|B.B.Bunnies]] spawn, delay 2~14 seconds<sup>60f~420f</sup>.
*15 [[Squire Rel]]s (200%) spawn after 2 seconds<sup>60f</sup>, delay 2~8 seconds<sup>60f~240f</sup>.
*5 [[Pigge]]s spawn after 10 seconds<sup>300f</sup>, delay 8~24 seconds<sup>240f~720f</sup>.
*3 [[Kang Roo]]s spawn after 20 seconds<sup>600f</sup>, delay 0.07~0.67 seconds<sup>2f~20f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 90% HP:
**1 [[Squire Rel]] (100%) spawns as the boss.
**Infinite [[Ghost Doge]]s spawn, delay 12~16 seconds<sup>360f~480f</sup>.
**Infinite [[Ghost Snache]]s spawn, delay 20~22 seconds<sup>600f~660f</sup>.
**3 [[Ghost Doge]]s spawn, delay 0.67~2 seconds<sup>20f~60f</sup>.
**3 [[Ghost Snache]]s spawn, delay 0.67~2 seconds<sup>20f~60f</sup>.
**3 [[Teacher Bear]]s spawn, delay 0.07~0.67 seconds<sup>2f~20f</sup>.
**1 [[Dashing Face]] spawns.
**Infinite [[Dashing Face]]s spawn, delay 30~32 seconds<sup>900f~960f</sup>.

==Strategy==
It is recommended to get at least all of [[Empire of Cats]] Chapter 1 superior [[Treasure]]s before attempting to beat this stage. If you have done this, then you can basically spawn any of the [[:Category:Normal Cats|Normal Cats]] to win.

